{"_type":"shard","campaign_names":["Roanoke S3","Roanoke Season 3","roanoke-s3"],"channel":{"category":"🏡 Player made buildings, Roanoke","id":"740291949843447869","name":"leafs-lookout","position":80,"server_id":"636012145204527125","topic":null,"type":"0"},"database_path":"discord/roanoke-season-3/roanoke-season-3.sqlite","database_sha256":"16d47fa7c4f38d18670fc7fc2639614b0b61c31f716d8e6ecba86f1f87412b4d","project_ids":["roanoke-s3"],"server":{"harvested_at":"2026-10-01T23:13:18Z","id":"636012145204527125","name":"Roanoke Season 3"},"server_slug":"roanoke-season-3"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf's Lookout- Leaf's new home based on a real tree from from my childhood family camp (I have some pictures too!). A wide tree that once was thought rotten and long dead now  has bright green leaves despite missing most of the center of it's trunk. There's an opening in the tree just big enough for most to duck into and stand inside. Here they can look all the way up through the tree to the sky where the branches open up. Those willing can climb up the tunnel to look out the top of the tree through the branches and green leaves. The tunnel is just big enough to happily fit a small goblin and her trinkets. Preferably, it's not far from the other tree houses and can be connected by a bridge or nice path. Eventually there will be a platform at the top so others can visit and watch the stars, and maybe even a swing to commemorate the real life tree.","created_at":"2020-08-04T19:36:15.668000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740292037361926155","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
