{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"(Wish I had better pictures of the full tree but basically this is a tree that exists in real life at the family camp my grandparents help run. We called it the \"Pooh tree\" after Winnie-the-Pooh. Most of the time I was there it didn't have leaves and was starting to rot away, but last time I went there it'd somehow grown bright green leaves and the camp built a nice platform at the top ~~so dumb kids like my cousins would stop falling off~~. As you can see in those first two pictures, my little cousin was really excited to climb it.)","created_at":"2020-08-04T19:47:18.003000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740294815396397088","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
