{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf crawls into her tree to rest until it's time to find Daysong","created_at":"2020-08-05T02:33:55.363000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740397145341034578","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf crawls into her tree, exhausted from the day. She places the chisel on the shelf next to all her letters. Her hand hovers over the flower Web gave her. She'd been meaning to talk to them for a long time... So much happened on that dang sub, and Web is one of the few people left around to ask questions to. But does she really want to know? Deep down Leaf knows that the names Castor gave her still eat her up inside. And now that Web can talk... Maybe? Her hand falls back and Leaf curls up at the bottom of the tree. She has a thought, that maybe it would be better to go back before she got the note from Copper. She smiles ||But then I would have never found you!|| She falls asleep imagining Mello swimming happily in her tank.","created_at":"2020-08-05T08:38:20.129000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740488852816527412","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
