{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf wakes feeling much happier than she did the day before. She peeks her head out if the tree and sees Sandigill painting. \"Oh good morning Sandi!\"","created_at":"2020-08-05T16:30:32.560000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740607687645200434","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"as sandi collects his things and stands back up, a medium sized stone basin appears near the base of the tree.  It is filled with water, and has a stone koi fish exactly resembling the koi that gil fed the berry to un the ocean.  gil puts his hand on the base of the tree, says a small prayer, grabs his cane and walks off.","created_at":"2020-08-05T16:39:57.409000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740610056793489482","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf smiles at Sandi as he walks away. She crawls out of the tree and scoops the basin into her lap, sitting and watching the stone fish through the water. After a few minutes, Leaf gently reaches a finger into the basin and boops the fish delicately on the nose. It begins to glow a soft white and reflect through the water. She smiles and gives the basin a small squeeze, something like a hug. \"Thank you\" she whispers to the little fish. She sits happily with her goddess like this for a long while. \n(Because I have a dentist appointment :p)","created_at":"2020-08-05T17:00:21.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740615191968088144","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"<@297577343554158603> you may use stone Mello as a divine focus if you wish","created_at":"2020-08-05T18:25:16.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740636559405088829","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf leads the group to her tree. In addition to what's described in the pinned posts, the opening of the tree is lined with a wreath of flowers from both Roanoke and London. Leaf sits in the \"doorway\". Behind her you can see the inside of the tree is hollow and lined with various trinkets she's collected since meeting you all. \"I'm still working on things up top,\" she points upward, \"it's a surprise. I want everything to be ready before you see it. For now, down here is nice too.\" She gestures to the grass at the tree's roots where a bed of flowers has already begun to take shape. <@363458590461132800> <@260949833773219840>","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:36:32.934000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740805492590248009","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"In this moment. This is exactly what Cato needed. A peaceful home. A place to rest. \"Thank you Leaf.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:38:09.943000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740805899475615744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
