{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Baeshra bonks Cato on the head with an empty hand. \"Mad no mean hate. Hurt no mean hate. Baeshra much mad. Baeshra still care for Cato.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:43:01.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740807120517070888","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"You want go see matron. Fine. Much big time. We just get to Row Kanok.  You want leave? Need fish-boat. Go long trip back. See matron. Then what? But no. Cato change mind no want go. Want stay. Cato know love in Row Kanok. Love with tribe. So why Cato hurt Cato? Why Cato hurt Wren?\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:46:23.936000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740807971432431636","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Aerith","id":"260949833773219840","is_bot":0,"username":"aerith_of_aer"},"author_id":"260949833773219840","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"The fact that I was willing to leave. That I wanted to. That I was ok with leaving her. I don't think I can ever forgive myself for that. I wanted to abandon her.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:47:49.512000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740808330364059749","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"\"Bah!\" Baeshra bonks Cato again. \"Many people want things, not all good things. People change mind like seasons too. Cato no want go no. Cato stay. In Row Kanok. In tribe. Cato need look in. Cato make missed steak. Baeshra tell Baeshra much big missed steak. Learn from missed steak. Grow from missed steak. Talk to Wren. Sorry to Wren.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T05:52:43.988000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740809565486055435","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
