{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"After a few moments of braiding, Leaf walks out of the tree and quietly puts a flower crown on Cato's head before heading to <#739055141759615027> to pick up a few things.","created_at":"2020-08-06T06:47:18.433000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740823299503816744","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Sketchy Bee 🐝","id":"297577343554158603","is_bot":0,"username":"sketchybee"},"author_id":"297577343554158603","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"Leaf returns somber, soaked from the waist down, carrying four white water lilies in her arms. She brings them to the basin and one by one places each flower in the water, taking a moment to watch them float around the stone Mello. Finally, she brings the basin up to the top of the tree and places it gently in the crook of a branch facing the Château. She sits up on the branch, once again watching the flowers float and spin in the water. Having never been to a temple of the Wild Mother, she imagines that perhaps this is what one would be like. Small. Simple. Peaceful. \nLeaf climbs down into the tree for a moment and comes back up holding a few small items in her hands. First, she leans the holy symbol she got from Navar against the side of the basin, along with the last letter he'd left her on the sub. Next she opens a small box and in a similar fashion Leaf arranges the coral carved statue of Melora next to Ebuc's last letter, finally actually slipping on the ring of force resistance. She says the names again, this time with a small smile. \"Calmation, Amara, Ebuc and Navar. Lost, not gone. Just like you were, Mello.\"","created_at":"2020-08-06T07:35:29.146000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-06T07:42:20.782000Z","id":"740835424033046539","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"740291949843447869","content":"<@!297577343554158603> \nLeaf wakes up in her tree as usual, except something feels off. The tree doesn’t feel woody and strong, it's weak and is crumbling around her. As it is about to fall in on her completely, she is submerged in a dark black water. She swims to the surface and finds herself in the Oasis. The water around her smells of rotting fish, where is sandigill? She makes it to shore and when she looks around, everything she sees is black, burt, and full of decay. Leaf pulls out her holy symbol to pray to the Wild Mother. Just as she begins to pray the symbol cracks and crumbles in her hands. Black begins to creep up her hands -wakes up-\n\nYou see this in your nightmares, gain an exhaustion point, and do not gain the benefits of a long rest","created_at":"2020-08-06T09:34:48.057000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"740865450682089522","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
